   "seed": 976888196,
   "text": "Read top to bottom: A Dashboard \u00b7 B Suppliers (list \u2192 drawers \u2192 the six profile tabs) \u00b7 C Purchase orders \u00b7 D Receiving \u00b7 E Pay & return \u00b7 F Reports.\nNo PO approval \u00b7 every create/edit is a drawer over its list \u00b7 language switcher shows English / \u062f\u0631\u06cc / \u067e\u069a\u062a\u0648 only \u00b7 qty to receive is capped at remaining.\nLanded cost = unit + share of shipping \u00b7 A/P lives in finance_payables \u00b7 posted receipts are immutable",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Read top to bottom: A Dashboard \u00b7 B Suppliers (list \u2192 drawers \u2192 the six profile tabs) \u00b7 C Purchase orders \u00b7 D Receiving \u00b7 E Pay & return \u00b7 F Reports.\nNo PO approval \u00b7 every create/edit is a drawer over its list \u00b7 language switcher shows English / \u062f\u0631\u06cc / \u067e\u069a\u062a\u0648 only \u00b7 qty to receive is capped at remaining.\nLanded cost = unit + share of shipping \u00b7 A/P lives in finance_payables \u00b7 posted receipts are immutable",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
