   "text": "Read-only. Open POs = procurement_purchase_orders.status IN (draft, ordered, partial_received). Total A/P = SUM(finance_payables.balance_amount) \u2014 never from the PO cache. \uff0b New PO and \uff0b Supplier open drawers over their lists, they do not open extra pages.",
