   "originalText": "Reads procurement_suppliers LEFT JOIN finance_payables (balance) and procurement_purchase_orders (open PO count). This page NEVER shows a form. \uff0b New supplier and row Edit open B2 / B3 drawers \u2014 the list stays behind. Filter, sort and column picker live inside the table header, like a sheet.",
